---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Our Canonical Communion | True Orthodox Church | St. John of Kronstadt"
  description="St. John of Kronstadt is in communion with the Orthodox Metropolia, Avlona Synod USA, and the True Orthodox Church of Russia (IPC Katakomb) — the historic Catacomb Church."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-tan-dark">Our Canonical Family</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Our Communion</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-text-primary/80">
      A full account of our canonical standing — the Orthodox Metropolia, the Avlona Synod
      (USA), and our sister synod the Истинно-Православная Церковь (IPC Katakomb) of Russia,
      heir to the Catacomb Church — coming soon.
    </p>

    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-text-primary/80">
      <li>
        <a href="https://orthodoxmetropolia.org" rel="noopener external">
          Orthodox Metropolia ↗
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://avlonasynodusa.com" rel="noopener external">
          Avlona Synod USA ↗
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://ipckatakomb.ru" rel="noopener external">
          IPC Katakomb (Russia) ↗
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
